  "extract": "Heart failure (HF), also known as congestive heart failure (CHF), is a syndrome caused by an impairment in the heart's ability to fill with and pump blood.",
  "extract_html": "<p><b>Heart failure</b> (<b>HF</b>), also known as <b>congestive heart failure</b> (<b>CHF</b>), is a syndrome caused by an impairment in the heart's ability to fill with and pump blood.</p>"
